WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Start with the part you can observe.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Follow the relationship as it changes.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
Bearings support moving parts and manage contact under load. Lubrication separates surfaces in many operating conditions; it does not remove every loss.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
Map shaft load → bearing contact → lubricant film → heat removal, then list what the simple map leaves out.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Choose evidence from scenarios

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
This ideal mechanism leaves out friction, temperature and part-specific behavior. Real designs need measurements.

